      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Stunning riverside home located in a beautiful Clonakilty countryside setting, offering the perfect balance of peaceful rural living with excellent convenience. \n\nSet back from the road on its own generous plot of 0.8 acres with direct access to the Argideen River the property is within walking distance to Clonakilty Golf course. \n\nBuilt a few years ago this property has a bang up to date modern layout, with the living areas at the bright side of the house and the 3 bedroom/2 bathroom wing facing onto the garden below.\n\nComplimented by a large detached 600 Sqft double garage. The house has an excellent B energy rating which should qualify for green rate mortgages. \n\nClonakilty is cosmopolitan and welcoming seaside town at the heart of West Cork which boasts 12 beaches within 12 miles. Clonakilty offers an exceptional quality of life, combining coastal charm with modern convenience. This vibrant town is renowned for its friendly community, excellent schools, and lively cultural scene, including festivals, music, and artisan food. \nInchydoney beach is also only a short drive, adding to the lifestyle appeal of this superb location.\n\nAccommodation c. 151 m² / 1626 ft² \n\nEntrance Hall 4.7 x 2.9 m\nSuperb spacious entrance hall with a luxurious finish. Bright and welcoming with polished porcelain floor tiling, featuring a large Velux window flooding the room with light. \n\nKitchen / Dining Room 6.4 m x 4.5 m\nExceptional, large open kitchen/dining area with polished porcelain floor tiling and solid wooden cabinetry. This family-sized space benefits from a southerly aspect allowing for an abundance of natural light. Designed for family living and entertaining it easily intercommunicates with the sitting room. \n\nSitting Room 5.5 m x 4.5 m \nBeautiful double doors lead to the spacious sitting room with a feature fireplace. Solid wood flooring. Large south facing window\n\nUtility Room 2.6 m x 1.5 m & 1.2 m x 1.5 m\nWell-appointed utility room with ample storage, door to hotpress and door to the rear of the house.\n\nBathroom 2.7 m x 2.1 m \nFabulous fully tiled walk-in shower room with WC, double WHB, shower and a large feature illuminated mirror.\n\nBedroom One with Ensuite 4 m x 5 m\nLarge ensuite bedroom carpeted throughout.\n\nEnsuite 2.5 m x 2.3 m \nFully tiled WC/Shower room \n\nBedroom Two with Walk-in wardrobe 2.8 m x 4 m\nSpacious double bedroom carpeted throughout.\n\nWalk-in wardrobe 2.5m x 1.5 m \n\nBedroom Three 4 m x 3.7 m\nSpacious double bedroom carpeted throughout\n\nServices\n\n•BER B energy rating\n•Oil-fired zoned central heating \n•Private well water supply with UV filtration system\n•Septic tank\n•Fibre broadband available \n•UPVC double glazed window`s throughout \n•Solid fuel stove in sitting room\n\n\nOutside\nSet on approximately c. 0.8 acres with green lawn areas to the front and rear. Expansive tarmac driveway with stone wall, pillars, electronic gates and extensive parking. Substantial double garage with pedestrian and double roller door. Beautiful raised patio area. \n\n"
      },
